(   7. Cancellation: XHR uses `xhr.abort\(\)`; Fetch uses `AbortController`.) Tj
T*
(   8. Upload Progress: XHR supports `xhr.upload.onprogress`; Fetch lacks native upload progress) Tj
T*
(   monitoring without Streams.) Tj
T*
